<title>POLAND: POLISH BANKS BID FOR PLN 1.274 BLN OF NBP-BILLS.</title>
<headline>POLISH BANKS BID FOR PLN 1.274 BLN OF NBP-BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish banks bid for 673 million zlotys of 182-day NBP-bills, maturing on Feb 27, 1997, against a 500 million zloty central bank offer, the NBP said.</p>
<p>Banks also bid for 601 million zlotys of 273-day bills, due May 29, 1997, against a 500 million zloty offer.</p>
<p>Results of the auction should be available later today.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
